  "steps": [
    "Warm the corn tortillas in a dry pan over medium heat for 20 to 30 seconds per side, then keep them wrapped so they stay soft.",
    "Crumble the tofu into a bowl with your hands or a fork so it looks like small curds.",
    "Heat the olive oil in a non-stick frying pan over medium heat. Add the onion and red pepper and cook for 3 to 4 minutes until softened.",
    "Add the garlic, turmeric, paprika and cumin, then cook for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the tofu, salt and black pepper. Cook for 4 to 5 minutes, stirring often, until the tofu is hot and lightly golden in spots.",
    "Add the spinach and cook for 1 minute until just wilted. Finish with the lime juice.",
    "Divide the scramble between the tortillas, top with salsa and avocado, and serve straight away."
